    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bouncing to the Top with Quantum Quacks</strong> is a challenging physics-based game where your goal is to reach the top of the level without falling. You control a constantly bouncing ball and can only influence its movement to the left or right, adapting to the terrain to keep climbing. The controls are easy to learn but hard to master. A single mistake can cost you all your progress and force you to start from the bottom. Along the way, themed rubber duckies are hidden throughout the stage. Try to find them all if you can!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bouncing to the Top with Quantum Quacks</strong> is a challenging physics-based game where your goal is to reach the top of the level without falling. You control a constantly bouncing ball and can only influence its movement to the left or right, adapting to the terrain to keep climbing. The controls are easy to learn but hard to master. A single mistake can cost you all your progress and force you to start from the bottom. Along the way, themed rubber duckies are hidden throughout the stage. Try to find them all if you can!</p>",
    "short_description": "Bounce to the top with Quantum Quacks! Master the physics of a challenging 2D world, collect hidden ducks, and experience the ultimate rage game. One fall, start over. Are you ready to defy gravity and collect all the ducks?",
